# Publish AHS Imports

After finishing meaningful website changes, commit them and push to `origin/main` so Vercel updates https://ahs-imports.vercel.app. Do this by default unless the user says not to deploy.

- Never commit secrets, `.env`, or `.env.local`.
- Do not change git config. If a commit identity is required, pass it only for that command.
- Prefer `git push origin HEAD`. Do not force-push.
- Confirm the live homepage reflects the change before saying production is updated.
